  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S5-75 Sunfunder Entreprenurial Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S5-75 Sunfunder Entrepren&#xf6;rsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sun-Funder best&#xe5;r av en l&#xe5;neplattform som till&#xe5;ter investeringar med  h&#xf6;g p&#xe5;verkningsgrad f&#xf6;r solenergiprojekt i l&#xe5;ginkomstl&#xe4;nder. IAP      finiaserar projektet &quot;SunFunder Risk Management Toolkit&quot; som kommer   systematsitk att arbete med att utveckla deras ledningssystem. Avtalspart &#xe4;r SunFunder Inc., org.nr 36-4747545, USA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SunFunder (SF) provides a lending platform that allows for investments in high-impact and vetted solar projects in low-income, off-grid      communities around the world. The IAP funded project will focus on dev. SF risk management Toolkit which will be used to systematically  how SF vets, selects monitors and scales loans to solar companies. Agreement partner is SunFunder Inc., org reg no 36-4747545, USA.</narrative>
  </description>
